body:
> Path3D editor spams errors when you clear all points when points are selected.

@KoBeWi I just looked at this behaviour for current master, and it seems like this error predates my changes, and I'm able to reproduce it with the current version of master.

Im happy to raise a subsequent PR to try to address this if I can think of any way, but looking into it, it seems like the call to render the gizmo happens on every update gets hit with an error condition once we clear the points, I guess we could try to deselect the points first, so the gizmo draw call wouldn't happen?
